        <mxCell id="ZRm1rRep4JDU7bXdmNCl-28" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shape=mxgraph.basic.rectCallout;dx=30;dy=15;boundedLbl=1;" value="Il wrapper &lt;i&gt;CodaWrapper &lt;/i&gt;semplicemente wrappa una coda, cioè la prende come costruttuore, rimanda a lei per i metodi empty, full e getSize.&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;I metodi inserisci e preleva sono invece implementati nelle particolari versioni (lock, semafori, synchronized), chiamando sempre&lt;i&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(32, 32, 32); font-family: &amp;quot;JetBrainsMono NF&amp;quot;, Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; text-align: left; white-space: pre; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;coda.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;JetBrainsMono NF&amp;quot;, Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; text-align: left; white-space: pre; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(130, 80, 223);&quot;&gt;preleva&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(32, 32, 32); font-family: &amp;quot;JetBrainsMono NF&amp;quot;, Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; text-align: left; white-space: pre; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;() &lt;/span&gt;&lt;i&gt;e&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(32, 32, 32); font-family: &amp;quot;JetBrainsMono NF&amp;quot;, Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; text-align: left; white-space: pre; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;coda.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;JetBrainsMono NF&amp;quot;, Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; text-align: left; white-space: pre; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#8250df&quot;&gt;inserisci&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(32, 32, 32); font-family: &amp;quot;JetBrainsMono NF&amp;quot;, Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; text-align: left; white-space: pre; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;(int i)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
